    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40309" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινέφελ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clouded, overcast</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				65
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπινεφέλων ἐόντων</span> the
			weather being <i>cloudy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.37
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				939b15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν ἐπινέφελον ᾖ</span>,
			opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθρίας οὔσης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				369b23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.</u>
				939b39
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. οὖρον</span>
